Subject: QB.1 the member bound stated in the owner's log
Why: hyper-raft stops a member handed a configuration past the members it was opened for, so a group's bound has to grow with it: Amphora states the bound in its log (lane constants-21), and the core raises its own as it takes an entry that states one (Raft::state_members), before the change behind it takes effect, and when an owner's image states a larger one (Replica::grow_members)

